Subject: vg rna: divide nodes at exon boundaries without vg::augment

Stage A opportunity 3. Applies on top of 0002. Keeps augment's first pass
(find_breakpoints, forwardize_breakpoints, ensure_breakpoints, in the same
order with the same break_ends setting) so node division and new node ids are
unchanged, then fills translation_index directly from the map
ensure_breakpoints returns. Drops augment's second pass, its walk over every
embedded path step, make_translation (2N protobuf Translations, their sort and
reverse-complement copies) and the 2N MessageDifferencer comparisons.
See README.md for the equivalence argument and the intron-route caveat.

